---
import Layout from '../layouts/base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/hero.astro';
import CTASection from '../components/ctaSection.astro';
import paisaje from '../paisaje.jpg';
---

<Layout title="About">
  <Hero backgroundImage={paisaje} title="About" subtitle="Learn more about my mission and values" />
  
  <div class="p-8 max-w-4xl mx-auto">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-4">About me</h1>
    <p class="text-lg text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line">
      I am a Web Developer focused on building maintainable, scalable, and standards-compliant solutions with WordPress.

I develop custom functionality with a strong emphasis on clean architecture, performance, and long-term maintainability. My workflow prioritizes security-first development and extensibility.

I work leveraging modern development approaches while ensuring full compatibility with WordPress core principles: solutions that integrate cleanly into existing ecosystems without introducing technical debt.

I approach projects with a systems mindset, focusing on clarity, documentation, and sustainable development practices that support long-term growth and collaboration. All my work is GDPR compliant by default.
    </p>
  </div>

  <CTASection 
    title="Get in Touch"
    content="Call us to +11 111 111 111"
  />
</Layout>